      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Our Story",
        "heading": "Beauty, Inspired by Nature",
        "text": "CHIC began with a simple belief — that nature gives us the purest form of care. Every product is crafted with the finest botanical ingredients, without harmful chemicals, so you can feel good about what you put on your skin and hair. What started as a small passion for Ayurvedic remedies has grown into a complete ritual wardrobe for skin, hair and body.",
        "btn_label": "Explore Our Products",
        "btn_link": "shopify://collections/all"
      }
    },
