        "eyebrow": "Our Mission",
        "heading": "Honest Beauty, For Every Home",
        "text": "We believe luxury botanical care should not be a privilege. Our mission is to bring clean, effective, Ayurveda-inspired beauty to every home in India — formulations that respect your skin, your values and the planet. Every jar and bottle is a promise: no shortcuts, no harsh chemicals, only nature perfected.",
